msgid "More choice. The House would like to see what you pick."
msgstr "Meer keus. Het Huis ziet graag wat je kiest."

#: scripts/story/story_lines.gd
msgid "Copies are kept of everything."
msgstr "Van alles worden kopieën bewaard."

#: scripts/story/story_lines.gd
msgid "Fragile. Breakage is the holder's responsibility."
msgstr "Breekbaar. Breuk komt voor rekening van de houder."

#: scripts/story/story_lines.gd
msgid "A second request is processed faster."
msgstr "Een tweede verzoek wordt sneller verwerkt."

#: scripts/story/story_lines.gd
msgid "Every angle is billable."
msgstr "Elke hoek is declarabel."

#: scripts/story/story_lines.gd
msgid "Results compound. So does scrutiny."
