#. Kit's notes and the House's papers. Kit writes by hand and signs —K.; the House types in capitals. Keep a run of dots between a label and its value, and a " · " between items.
#: scripts/story/story_notes.gd
msgid "If you're reading this, you're in the chair now. It isn't bad. Nothing happens. Things get decided and a name goes on them. I said no the first time. It was the only thing I ever did that they didn't see coming."
msgstr "Als je dit leest, zit jij nu op de stoel. Het valt mee. Er gebeurt niets. Er worden dingen besloten en er komt een naam onder. De eerste keer zei ik nee. Het was het enige wat ik ooit deed dat ze niet zagen aankomen."

